# Avatar source art is TRACKED on purpose. It is ~20MB of Gemini renders that
# cannot be regenerated -- the model does not reproduce the same character
# twice, which is how gather.png ended up in different trousers from the other
# three shooting frames. The shipped .webp layers are small keyed derivatives,
# so losing these originals would be permanent. Git is the backup.

# The one exception: an NBA 2K screenshot, kept locally as a style reference for
# the court. This repo is public, and that is someone else's copyrighted art.
src/assets/avatar/courtviz.png
